gpt2codex (0.1.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Run experimental armhf builds and tests under a full-system ARMv7 kernel
    to preserve exact process generation checks.
  * Use distinct pinned Debian platform images and isolated host inspection.
  * Fix the stable release gate after successful mandatory validation.
  * Retain categorical attention identity errors and remove the temporary
    cross-process diagnostic probe without removing functional tests.
  * Refresh stable package metadata; arm64 and armhf remain experimental.

